  "description": "When the hottest girl in school offers Wonyoung a part-time position at her family’s women-only boarding house, Wonyoung is stoked. But when she ditches him and her family yelling how she doesn’t want to work at a boarding house filled with a bunch of “creepy” women, Wonyoung starts to wonder what he’s gotten himself into... Turns out the building is built on some inauspicious land, amplifying sexual desire to an uncontrollable state. It's Wonyoung’s job to help curb that desire for the reputation of the boarding house, and the sanity of the ladies living there.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
